# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Image masters
#
# The site serves the .webp derivatives (max 1600px, q82) generated from the
# full-resolution masters. The masters are ~413 MB and are the reason .git is
# over 400 MB.
#
# They are still TRACKED, so this file does not exclude them. Untracking them
# (git rm --cached) would leave them on disk but unbacked-up, and would not
# shrink history without a rewrite. Decide deliberately before changing this.
#
#   images/**/*.png
#   images/**/*.jpg
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
